<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN SCOTTISH PREMIER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the Scottish</p>
<p>premier division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>22 - Jorge Cadete (Celtic)</p>
<p>15 - Brian Laudrup (Rangers), Paul Wright (Kilmarnock)</p>
<p>13 - Billy Dodds (Aberdeen), Paul Gascoigne (Rangers),</p>
<p>Gerry Britton (Dunfermline)</p>
<p>12 - John Robertson (Hearts), Kjetil Olafsson</p>
<p>(Dundee United)</p>
<p>11 - Darren Jackson (Hibernian), Paolo Di Canio</p>
<p>(Celtic)</p>
</text>
